software/cmodel/build/

# ── Generated weight blob ────────────────────────────
#  software/export/weights.hex is a byte-for-byte concatenation of the
#  per-layer *_w.hex files that are already tracked, in program order. 8.8 MB
#  of pure duplication, and one command rebuilds it:
#      python scripts/gen_program.py --emit
#  The small params_*.hex are tracked, because they are NOT a concatenation:
#  they materialise the RES_ADD and GAP constants per channel.
software/export/weights.hex
